---
import BlogShell from "@/layouts/BlogShell.astro";
import { SITE } from "@/config";
---

<BlogShell
  title={`About | ${SITE.title}`}
  mode="discovery"
  rail="discovery"
  activePage="about"
>
  <link rel="preload" as="image" href="/jacob_profile.webp" slot="head" />
  <!-- Hero: avatar + name + subtitle -->
  <div class="flex items-center gap-7 mb-8">
    <img
      src="/jacob_profile.webp"
      alt="Jacob"
      width="128"
      height="128"
      fetchpriority="high"
      decoding="sync"
      class="shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover"
      style="width:128px; height:128px;"
    />
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
      <h1 class="text-[32px] font-bold tracking-tight leading-none">Jacob</h1>
      <p class="text-[14px] leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--fg-mute);">글쓰기를 좋아하는 어느 개발자의 기록 저장소</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ABOUT -->
  <p class="bd-overline mb-3">About</p>
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pb-8 border-b border-border" style="color: var(--fg-mute);">
    <p>
    자주 읽고, 때때로 쓰며, 그 사이에서 생긴 조각들을 이 곳에 이어둡니다.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- WHAT I'M DOING NOW -->
  <p class="bd-overline mt-8 mb-3">What I'm doing now</p>
  <ul class="flex flex-col gap-3 text-[14px] pb-8 border-b border-border">
    <li class="flex gap-3">
      <span class="shrink-0 w-4" style="color: var(--cat-thought);">—</span>
      <span>스치듯 지나가는 생각을 놓치지 않으려고 애쓰는 중</span>
    </li>
    <li class="flex gap-3">
      <span class="shrink-0 w-4" style="color: var(--cat-tech);">—</span>
      <span>가치 있는 프로덕트를 만드려고 고군분투 중</span>
    </li>
    <li class="flex gap-3">
      <span class="shrink-0 w-4" style="color: var(--cat-writing);">—</span>
      <span>어설픈 소설쓰기를 연습하는 중</span>
    </li>
    <li class="flex gap-3">
      <span class="shrink-0 w-4" style="color: var(--cat-book);">—</span>
      <span>보고 읽은 것을 무엇이든 남기는 중</span>
    </li>
  </ul>

</BlogShell>
